name ncclatex
category Package
revision 15878
shortdesc An extended general-purpose class
relocated 1
longdesc The ncc class provides a framework for a common class to
longdesc replace the standard article, book and report classes, and
longdesc providing a "preprint" class. The class's extensions are
longdesc provided in a number of small packages, some of which may also
longdesc be used with the standard classes. The ncclatex package also
longdesc loads many of the packages of, and requires the latest version
longdesc of the ncctools bundle.
